                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Sticky on/off switch for the prediction (a toggle, not a momentary button). On: every input change re-runs inference. Off: inference is skipped and the last result stays on the outputs, so the canvas can be rewired without paying for a solve. A wired boolean works the same as the inline switch.</item>
